From 63385e05de110c0d792beb3b149470c7763a2e81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cruz <cruz@tbu.net>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:24:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 016/206] feat(shorebird): wrapper Layout and the two direction
 configs

Layout field order, offsets and 0x60 size mirror their DWARF. The wrapper
count is derived from (page_size - shared_body_size) / landing_pad_size,
which reproduces both of their constants: 2014 for CPUToSim and 2044 for
SimToCPU, the latter a truncated 2044.5. kSharedBodySize (272 vs 28) is the
only substantive difference between the two directions.

Stub code ranges are empty until the stub generators exist in plan #2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

